# Light interceptor-class missile: quick, cheap, disposable. One PD blink kills it,
# but it cycles nearly twice as fast as a harpoon and sips capacitor -- saturation
# and finishing work, not door-kicking.
id          skewer_pod
name        "Skewer Light Missile"
kind        missile
size        S
icon        ic-missile
damage      14
reload      2.2
proj_speed  12000
proj_life   250
proj_radius 4.5
cap_cost    12
emission    0.8
proj_hp     1.5
price       500
tier        1
engage_range 45000
# Snappy cold launch: light round, hard kick, short coast.
eject_speed  450
ignition_delay 0.3
desc "Featherweight seeker round. Any point-defense blink burns one down, but the rack cycles fast enough to ask the question twice."
